{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30600","headline":"杜司空席上赋 · 李宣古","name":"杜司空席上赋","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"红灯初上月轮高，照见堂前万朵桃。\n觱栗调清银象管，琵琶声亮紫檀槽。\n能歌姹女颜如玉，解引萧郎眼似刀。\n争奈夜深抛耍令，舞来挼去使人劳。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李宣古","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30600.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30600","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}